OL,3,ATrump to meet Irish leader Micheal
OL,4,AMartin during visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has arrived
OL,7,Ffor a two-day visit to Ireland.
OL,9,FHe was greeted by Tanaiste (Irish
OL,10,Fdeputy prime minister) Simon Harris and
OL,11,FIrish Foreign Minister Helen McEntee at
OL,12,FDublin Airport on Saturday morning.
OL,14,FTrump will hold a courtesy call with
OL,15,FIrish President Catherine Connolly as
OL,16,Fwell as a bilateral meeting with
OL,17,FTaoiseach (Irish Prime Minister)
OL,18,FMicheal Martin. He will also attend
OL,19,Fevents at the US Ambassador to Ireland
OL,20,FEd Walsh's residence in Dublin's
OL,21,FPhoenix Park.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
